DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260114
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260115
SUMMARY:Ekadashi (fasting day)
DESCRIPTION:Computed from the tithi running at sunrise (panchang convention
 \, 06:00 IST approximation)\; regional calendars may shift it ±1 day. The
  11th tithi of the fortnight\, kept as a fast (vrat) by many Hindus.
END:VEVENT
